---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Advisory Services | Bioque Estates International Pvt. Ltd."
  description="Explore specialized luxury real estate services: New Chandigarh enclaves, Tri-City high-rises, Dubai Golden Visa acquisitions, and Springfield UAE partnership."
>
  <div class="bg-dark-950 text-white py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 border-b border-dark-850">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold text-[#D4AF37] uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Our Capabilities</span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-display tracking-tight text-white">
        Global Luxury Advisory Capabilities
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2 max-w-2xl">
        Bespoke portfolio advisory covering flagship developments across northern India and premier UAE destinations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 text-[#AA8222] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl border border-[#D4AF37]/30">
          🌳
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark-900 mb-3">New Chandigarh Flagship Enclaves</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Authorized advisory on Omaxe (The Lake, Mulberry Villas, Celestia Royal), DLF Hyde Park, Riseonic, and Eco City developments with priority allocation and developer pricing.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 text-[#AA8222] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl border border-[#D4AF37]/30">
          🏙️
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark-900 mb-3">Tri-City High-Rise Portfolios</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Curated penthouses, sky residences, and luxury apartments in Mohali, Zirakpur, and Chandigarh corridor (Homeland Infinia, Jubilee Parkfields, Motiaz, Aventus).
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 text-[#AA8222] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl border border-[#D4AF37]/30">
          🇦🇪
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark-900 mb-3">Dubai Waterfront & Sky Residences</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Direct partnership with Springfield Properties UAE providing VIP access to Palm Jebel Ali, Mercedes-Benz Places Downtown, Dubai Creek Harbour, and Sobha One.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 text-[#AA8222] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl border border-[#D4AF37]/30">
          🛂
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark-900 mb-3">10-Year UAE Golden Visa Advisory</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Complete assistance for qualifying property investments of AED 2M+ ensuring seamless family residency, banking setup, and long-term tax freedom in Dubai.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 text-[#AA8222] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl border border-[#D4AF37]/30">
          ⚖️
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark-900 mb-3">NRI Legal Conveyance & Due Diligence</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Remote transaction management, legal vetting, title verification, escrow monitoring, and registry execution for international and cross-border buyers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="springfield-card p-8">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 text-[#AA8222] flex items-center justify-center mb-6 font-bold text-xl border border-[#D4AF37]/30">
          💼
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark-900 mb-3">Rental Asset & Yield Optimization</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          High-yielding rental structuring delivering 8-10% net tax-free returns in Dubai and premium tenant placement across New Chandigarh enclaves.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 bg-dark-900 text-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 text-center border border-[#D4AF37]/30">
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-display mb-4">Request Private Portfolio Session</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8">
        Meet with our principal advisors at our Chandigarh Madhya Marg corporate office or arrange an online consultation.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-gold px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-extrabold inline-block">
        Schedule Private Consultation
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
